            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The output of `:buffers!` indeed shows that there is nothing wrong with 'mini.icons'. The current buffer is buffer 1 (indicated by `%`) while 'mini.icons' buffer is unlisted.\nThis might be an issue with plugin/code temporarily changing buffer to it (maybe even the `vim.filetype.match()` itself, I am not quite sure) but the actual name is not rendered/drawn properly in lualine.\n\nClosing this as \"pretty sure not a 'mini.icons' issue\".",
